<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 4278 0 R/Alt(Two panels side by side. Left, titled A committee page draws on club: a large box, club's engram readers, every member, holds a smaller box, page readers, Dallas and you, entirely inside it. Below it the verdict: allowed. Right, titled A club page draws on committee: a large box, page readers, every member and Lambert, holds a smaller box, committee's engram readers, Dallas and you, so the page's readers spill far beyond the smaller box. Below it the verdict: refused, unless shared on purpose. A strip across the bottom says that on a team domain the page's readers also include everyone who can read its repository.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 11682 0 R>>
