4393 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 4394 0 R/Alt(A decision flow from top to bottom. First: may the writer open that domain? If not, the write is refused as if the domain did not exist. If so: does everyone who reads the page read that domain, the repository's readers too? Yes leads to written, the page carries the text. No leads on: did this person share it here already, for the same readers? Yes leads to written. No leads on: is a person there, with a client that can ask, which is never the case in a scheduled run? No leads to refused, nothing written: leave out the source and its text. Yes leads to the question, naming who reads the page, showing the text, with one box. A ticked box and Accept lead to written; a decline or no answer lead to refused.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[9]/Pg 11687 0 R>>
endobj
