4457 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 4458 0 R/Alt(Top row, left to right: an edit on disk, a restore or a change of readers leads to a section that draws on a domain fewer people read, which leads to a source_too_wide item in the queue, for curators who may open that domain. From the section a second arrow leads to the backup, which holds back the page, its threads and its own files, while the branch history keeps what went out earlier; meanwhile the page keeps serving. From the backup two arrows lead to two ways out: a person shares it on purpose in the Review, or a curator removes the source and its text. Both lead to a wide box at the bottom: the item is gone and the page goes to the branch again. A dashed arrow runs from that box back to the section, labelled the page's readers widen later.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[18]/Pg 11689 0 R>>
endobj
